t:-9999px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;"/><div class="w-row"><div class="w-col w-col-6"><input class="text-field-footer pop-up dark custom-6523 w-input" name="name" data-name="name" placeholder="Name" type="text" id="name-4"/></div><div class="w-col w-col-6"><input class="text-field-footer pop-up dark custom-6523 w-input" name="company" data-name="company" placeholder="Unternehmen" type="text" id="company-2"/></div></div><div class="top-margin"><div class="w-row"><div class="w-col w-col-6"><input class="text-field-footer pop-up dark custom-6523 w-input" name="email" data-name="email" placeholder="E-Mail" type="email" id="email"/></div><div class="w-col w-col-6"><input class="text-field-footer pop-up dark custom-6523 w-input" name="phone" data-name="phone" placeholder="Telefonnummer" type="text" id="phone"/></div></div></div><div class="top-margin custom-7368"><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Worum geht es in Ihrem Projekt?" data-name="message" class="text-field-footer pop-up dark custom-6523 w-input"></textarea></div><div class="top-margin"><div class="align-center"><input type="submit" data-wait="Bitte warten.." class="button-icon form-button w-button" value="Abschicken"/></div></div></form><div class="success-message w-form-done"><div>Viele Dank! Ihre Anfrage wurde übermittelt. Wir werden uns schnellstmöglich bei Ihnen melden.</div></div><div class="error-message w-form-fail"><div>Oops, da ist etwas schiefgelaufen. Ihre Anfrage konnte leider nicht übermittelt werden.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="custom-0745"><div class="w-row"><div class="w-col w-col-6"><div class="custom-8563 w-clearfix"><div class="custom-1235"></div><div class="custom-1536"></div><div class="custom-1523"></div><div class="custom-1254"></div><div class="top-icon icon-5"></div><div class="custom-9563"><h3 class="heading-white custom-8574">Telefon</h3><div class="custom-9832">Rufen Sie uns einfach direkt an:<br/></div><div class="custom-1685"><a href="tel:+4932002002